> Inspect the native graph

The preview traces the actual canonical component with independent parameters; it does not alter training. Composite grouping keeps full unrolls readable.

```{cpp, results="markdown", file="figures/pointer_generator_network.svg", flags="-std=c++23 -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs datamunge) -lpthread -Wl,-rpath,$(pkg-config --variable=libdir datamunge)"}
